message: "If you use these materials, please cite them as below."
title: "Open Feynman-Path Molecular Nanotechnology: capability framework, prize reframe, and verifiable-task V&V"
abstract: >-
  A material-agnostic, capability-based reframing of the Feynman Grand Prize,
  a generalized capability-axes and characterization framework for productive
  nanosystems, and the machine-verifiable V&V data for the Feynman-Path
  (molecular-manipulator / mechanosynthesis) pursuit.
authors:
  - name: "Nano Dynamics Institute"
    website: "https://nanodynamics.institute"
license: Apache-2.0
date-released: "2026-06-16"
version: "0.1"
keywords:
  - molecular nanotechnology
  - mechanosynthesis
  - productive nanosystems
  - Feynman Grand Prize
  - verification and validation
